ot work until tapping inside the editor again.\n\nThis only happens on Android.\n\nThank you.\n\n<img width=\"1600\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53fc439f-4f7e-4fa5-a4b0-20900cef8a08\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n-*-\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n-*-","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119171/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119171/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}